function renderCompanyPanelMasterFields(base){const specs=[['particularities','companyPanelParticularitiesText','companyPanelParticularitiesFlag'],['notes','companyPanelNotesText','companyPanelNotesFlag']];for(const [field,inputId,flagId] of specs){const input=$('#'+inputId),flag=$('#'+flagId);if(!input)continue;const key=companyIdKey(base.id),value=String(base[field]||'');if(input.dataset.companyId!==key||input.dataset.dirty!=='1'){input.value=value;input.dataset.companyId=key;input.dataset.dirty='0'}if(flag){flag.textContent=value.trim()?'●':'';flag.title=value.trim()?'Há conteúdo cadastrado':'Sem conteúdo cadastrado'}}}

